  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the dwellinghouse at &lt;strong&gt;19 Grant Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7SB&lt;/strong&gt;, has been in use as two self-contained residential units for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nuse of the dwellinghouse at 19 Grant Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7SB,\r\nas two self-contained residential units, is immune from enforcement action and\r\nis therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as\r\namended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
